msgstr "按与鼠标光标的距离生成节点列表"

#: __init__.py:1750
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Generate object list by distance from the mouse cursor"
msgstr "按与鼠标光标的距离生成物体列表"

#: __init__.py:1248
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Node Cross Selector, supports Box/Lasso, Full/Half Match\n\n【Blue】: Fully Match (node fully inside range)\n【Orange】: Half Match (node partially inside range)\n\n【Shift】: Add Selection\n【Ctrl】: Subtract Selection"
msgstr "节点交叉选择器，支持框选/套索、完全/半匹配\n\n【蓝色】：完全匹配（节点完全在范围内）\n【橙色】：半匹配（节点部分在范围内）\n\n【Shift】：加选\n【Ctrl】：减选"

